    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every shirt found on the top side of the image, there is a set of arranged items: a handbag is placed below the shirt, and a pair of headphones is to the right of the shirt. Below the headphones, there is a pair of glasses. To the right of the handbag, there is a sock, followed by a pair of scissors to the right of the sock, and a knife to the right of the scissors. The shirt is visibly larger than the sock.",
